      "created_at": "2016-09-30T18:47:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If (on Mr. Fixer's turn), Mr. Fixer plays Overdrive while Time Crawls is out, what happens?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For most \"Use an additional power this turn\" cards, you don't get any power uses, because additional powers granted on your turn must be used during your power phase, which has been skipped. &nbsp;But Overdrive is weird enough that I wasn't sure if the same thing held true for it.</p>",
