      "created_at": "2016-09-30T22:50:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Additional powers in your turn must be used in the Powers Phase, since you have to skip your Power Phase to play Overdrive you can't use Strike if you play it in your turn.</p><p>Out of Turn card plays are a different matter entirely though.</p>",
